{"nodes":[{"id":"us_history","text":"美国历史是北美英属殖民地独立、建国并向全球扩张、演变为现代联邦共和国的过程。","parent":null},{"id":"us_history_example","text":"1776年《独立宣言》宣布13个殖民地脱离英国，是美国建国的起点。","parent":"us_history"},{"id":"period_colonial","text":"前殖民与殖民时期（约1607—1775）：1607年詹姆斯敦建立，英国在北美形成13个殖民地。","parent":null},{"id":"period_founding","text":"独立与建国（1775—1789）：1776年《独立宣言》，1787年《美国宪法》确立联邦制。","parent":null},{"id":"period_expansion","text":"西进与南北矛盾（1789—1861）：1803年路易斯安那购地扩张领土，奴隶制争议加剧。","parent":null},{"id":"period_civil_war","text":"内战与重建（1861—1877）：1861—1865年南北战争，1865年宪法第十三修正案废除奴隶制。","parent":null},{"id":"period_industry","text":"工业化与全球大国（1877—1945）：19世纪末工业化，1941—1945年参加第二次世界大战成为全球强国。","parent":null},{"id":"period_cold_war","text":"冷战与当代（1945—至今）：1947—1991年冷战，民权运动、信息时代与当代政治极化。","parent":null},{"id":"theme_federalism","text":"关键主题：联邦与州权。","parent":null},{"id":"theme_slavery","text":"关键主题：奴隶制与种族。","parent":null},{"id":"theme_immigration","text":"关键主题：移民。","parent":null},{"id":"theme_expansion","text":"关键主题：扩张。","parent":null},{"id":"theme_democracy","text":"关键主题：民主制度演变。","parent":null},{"id":"topic_source","text":"美国历史概览","parent":null},{"id":"note_limitation","text":"以上是概览，不同意历史学派对同一事件的解释会不同。","parent":null},{"id":"note_fact_speculation","text":"本回答按时期陈述的核心事件为事实性概括；历史解释与评价属推测或学派观点。","parent":null}],"edges":[{"from":"us_history","to":"us_history_example","label":"举例说明"},{"from":"us_history","to":"period_colonial","label":"包含阶段"},{"from":"us_history","to":"period_founding","label":"包含阶段"},{"from":"us_history","to":"period_expansion","label":"包含阶段"},{"from":"us_history","to":"period_civil_war","label":"包含阶段"},{"from":"us_history","to":"period_industry","label":"包含阶段"},{"from":"us_history","to":"period_cold_war","label":"包含阶段"},{"from":"period_colonial","to":"period_founding","label":"时间顺序过渡"},{"from":"period_founding","to":"period_expansion","label":"时间顺序过渡"},{"from":"period_expansion","to":"period_civil_war","label":"时间顺序过渡"},{"from":"period_civil_war","to":"period_industry","label":"时间顺序过渡"},{"from":"period_industry","to":"period_cold_war","label":"时间顺序过渡"},{"from":"period_founding","to":"theme_federalism","label":"体现主题"},{"from":"period_expansion","to":"theme_slavery","label":"激化矛盾"},{"from":"period_civil_war","to":"theme_slavery","label":"核心议题"},{"from":"period_industry","to":"theme_immigration","label":"伴随移民潮"},{"from":"period_cold_war","to":"theme_democracy","label":"涉及民主演变"},{"from":"period_expansion","to":"theme_expansion","label":"体现主题"},{"from":"us_history","to":"note_limitation","label":"限制说明"},{"from":"us_history","to":"note_fact_speculation","label":"事实与推测区分"},{"from":"topic_source","to":"us_history","label":"直接连接原始问题"},{"from":"topic_source","to":"note_limitation","label":"直接连接原始问题"}]}
